{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026MifljeCJtP1794474742.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB59周年《萬千星輝賀台慶》將於11月19日（下周四）隆重舉行！陳煒、陳敏之、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、葉蒨文、黃嘉雯、關嘉敏、陳熙蕊、黃靖靈（波波）等近30位女藝人日前齊聚電視城，為她們的表演環節「炫舞女王」進行舞蹈排練。 </p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ca9c63aa-8f11-456d-998f-a1b35d6f803d.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026T5iR5Abmwz1794474742.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>眾女星在排舞室大展曼妙舞姿及Fit爆身形，畫面極度養眼！陳煒、陳敏之、姚子羚及傅嘉莉更即興大玩「除外套」：「剛才嘅綵排重來都冇試過除衫」！</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"460ae200-9cf0-4615-b57d-927486c75780.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20260LcMyEGqc71794474741.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>TVB娛樂新聞台</p></p><p></p><p>期間，陳敏之意外上演「蝦碌」一幕，失手將外套飛到子羚身上，現場氣氛輕鬆又搞笑。 煒哥與敏之預告演出當晚不單只會在台上玩換裝，正式舞衣亦會更加性感：「再Hot啲更加Sexy，同埋會換衫畀你睇！」而一連串的養眼演出，其實是向一眾梳化服同事致敬，答謝他們的辛苦付出。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.924306+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:32:37.628567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.663365+00:00","content_hash":"84a6298c8f4c760c4f24a6d51062f364321e1e423093403074cb79ea9dc5b14b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.924306+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}